%description
Selenium is a test tool that allows you to write automated web application
UI tests in any programming language against any HTTP website using any
mainstream JavaScript-enabled browser. This module is an implementation of
the client for the Remote driver that Selenium provides.

%prep
%setup -q -n Selenium-Remote-Driver-%{version}

%build
perl Makefile.PL INSTALLDIRS=vendor NO_PACKLIST=1 NO_PERLLOCAL=1
%{make_build}

%install
%{make_install}
%{_fixperms} $RPM_BUILD_ROOT/*

%check
make test

%files
%doc Changes INSTALL.md README README.md
%license LICENSE
%{perl_vendorlib}/Selenium/
%{perl_vendorlib}/Test/
%{_mandir}/man3/Selenium::*3pm*
%{_mandir}/man3/Test::Selenium::*3pm*

